# Optional build-time override for the QR-code base URL.
#
# Normally you do NOT need to set this:
#  - Production (Docker):   the launcher injects the LAN IP at runtime.
#  - Dev (start-all.ps1):   the script auto-writes this file with the LAN IP.
#  - If left unset, the admin UI derives the URL from the current host:port 5173.
#
# Example (only if you want to hard-code it):
# VITE_QR_BASE_URL=https://192.168.178.44:5173/vote
